# Allow only runtime sources and the public sample corpus into the build context.
# This excludes .env*, .git, .venv, caches, tests, docs, scripts and data/index.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!app.py
!src/
!src/*.py
!data/
!data/sample_documents/
!data/sample_documents/irrigation.md
!data/sample_documents/soil_monitoring.txt
!data/sample_documents/koshihikari_heading_ja.md
!data/sample_documents/rice_heading_ja.md
!data/sample_documents/rice_heat_ja.md

# Explicit exclusions take precedence over directory allow rules above.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.env*
**/.venv/
**/.git/
